You have learned to sing the praises of the Moons, in the form of three defensive Hymns:

Hymn of Shadows: Increases your movement speed by [1%, 1%, 3%, 4%, 5% (SP 10-100)] and your spell casting speed by [0%, 0%, 1%, 1%, 2% (SP 10-100)].

Hymn of Detection: Increases your ability to see stealthy creatures by [0, 0, 1, 1, 2 (SP 10-100)] and invisible creatures by [0, 0, 1, 1, 2 (SP 10-100)], and increases your critical power by [0%, 1%, 2%, 4%, 5% (SP 10-100)].

Hymn of Perseverance: Increases your resistance to stun, confusion and blinding by 10%.

You may only have one Hymn active at a time.
